          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Curiosity | Textbook of Science | Grade 6"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.08,
            0.899,
            0.115,
            0.915
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "164"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.084,
            0.884,
            0.165
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "They go around the house to see the fields and the cattle. To keep them busy, Nani gives them a challenge of handpicking small stones from grains while keeping their eyes closed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.166,
            0.883,
            0.227
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The method of picking by hand from a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "mixture",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (when two or more substances are mixed) such as small stones and husk from wheat and rice is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "handpicking.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " It is done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.233,
            0.4,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.095,
                0.233,
                0.4,
                0.427
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.157,
                0.437,
                0.331,
                0.453
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 9.1: Handpicking"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.381,
            0.227,
            0.883,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "on the basis of differences in size, colour and shape of the particles. If the particles to be removed are present in small quantities and can easily be picked by hand, handpicking proves to be a convenient method."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.378,
            0.329,
            0.883,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "At lunch, Malli and Valli are served steaming hot vegetable pulao. While eating the pulao, Nani observes that Malli is separating whole black peppers from the pulao and is placing them aside on his plate (Fig. 9.1). Valli playfully teases, “Wow! This is a handpicking method, nice one!”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.471,
            0.882,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Nani tells them about the benefits of black pepper and encourages Malli to eat it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.285,
            0.513,
            0.883,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Later in the day, their Mama takes them to the fields"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.528,
            0.451,
            0.754
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.528,
                0.451,
                0.754
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_10.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_footnote",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.205,
                0.763,
                0.357,
                0.779
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 9.2: Threshing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.375,
            0.534,
            0.882,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "where they "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "observe",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " bundles of harvested"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.548,
            0.883,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "wheat stalks lying in the fields. Some stalks are spread in the sun for drying. Both of them pick up a stalk each and notice numerous grains attached to it. A group of farmers are beating the stalks on a large wooden log. Curiously, Valli asks Mama, “Why are they doing this?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.433,
            0.697,
            0.882,
            0.759
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mama explains, “They are beating the stalks to separate the grains” (Fig. 9.2). This process of separating grains"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.395,
            0.759,
            0.751,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "from the stalks is known as "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "threshing",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Farmers work hard,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.798,
            0.736,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "yet they enjoy their work. From time to time, they sing folk songs while working."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.855,
            0.695,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Explore",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " folk songs of your region and try to sing along with your friends."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.778,
            0.781,
            0.848,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": [
            {
